Hi @danielperna84 , thanks for your reply.
I don't have any template-sensor or automation running, which would somehow manipulate the state of the covers.
To double-check, I just turned off all of my automations and still noticed the behavior.

I did not perform any configuration changes while updating from 0.113.3 to 0.114.x / 0.115.x and as soon as I roll back to 0.113.3 with the exact same config, the behavior is not seen anymore.

I noticed the following:
When manually opening a cover by tapping the BROLL (the cover was fully closed), I noticed that the state changes to "open" directly after tapping the BROLL (which before only happened, when it reached the topmost position or was stopped manually).
Then, within less than a second another state_changed event is fired changing state back to "closed".
And after reaching the top position after some seconds, the state finally changes to "open" again (as expected).

