When doing it the other way around (closing a cover which is completely opened), this "toggling" of states does not happen and I only see a state_changed after the cover stopped in closing position).

I also noticed that the state toggling for covers which are neither fully opened nor closed as described in the initial message of this issue only happens for covers where HA thinks they are in "closed" state (real state 50% open as per CCU, but last moving direction down). The state does not toggle for covers where HA thinks they are in "open" state (real state 50% open as per CCU, but last moving direction up).

Is there any way to see which component / add-on etc. triggers those state_changed events? Does it maybe give some more visibility to run HA logger in debug mode for a specific component?

Thanks!
